# =============================================================================
# Velograph .gitignore — DEFAULT-DENY FOR DATA (PRD §12.2, CLAUDE.md)
#
# This is a PUBLIC repository. Nothing data-shaped is committable except the
# explicit synthetic-fixture allowlist below. Never bypass with `git add -f`;
# if a legitimate file is blocked, change these rules in a reviewed PR.
# This file is a guardrail, not the defense — the pre-commit privacy scanner
# and CI secret/data-leak scans are the blocking checks.
# =============================================================================

# --- Health data & export formats (denied everywhere) ------------------------
*.csv
*.gpx
# Health Auto Export artifacts, common naming variants
HealthAutoExport*
Health Auto Export*
Health-Auto-Export*
healthautoexport*

# --- Synthetic fixture allowlist (the ONLY re-include) -----------------------
# Invented values, invented dates, invented routes only — see CLAUDE.md.
# ZIP fixtures are never committed: build them at test runtime from these files.
!fixtures/synthetic/**/*.csv
!fixtures/synthetic/**/*.gpx

# --- Archives (raw exports and backups travel as these) ----------------------
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.gz
*.bz2
*.xz
*.7z
*.rar

# --- SQLite in every form ----------------------------------------------------
*.sqlite*
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.dump

# --- Application data, backups, generated output -----------------------------
# VELO_DATA_DIR must live OUTSIDE the checkout; these are insurance if it
# doesn't. Root-anchored so they can never shadow fixture or source subdirs.
/data/
/.data/
/velograph-data/
/.velograph/
/backups/
/backup/
/reports/
/exports/
/out/
*.backup
*.bak

# --- Logs & diagnostics (may embed sample values, env vars, absolute paths) --
*.log
logs/
log/
# Node diagnostic reports (report.<date>.<time>.<pid>.<tid>.json) dump full env
report.*.json
*.har
*.heapsnapshot
*.cpuprofile
*.heapprofile

# --- Credentials & local AI-provider state -----------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.keystore
.netrc
# .npmrc can carry registry auth tokens; commit a config-only one via reviewed PR
.npmrc
# Codex CLI auth cache filename — must never appear in the repo
auth.json
.codex/
.ollama/
# Claude Code local (unshared) state
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
# Agent harnesses create git worktrees here — each is a FULL nested copy of
# this repository. Never committable: a nested checkout could carry anything
# an agent generated (including data written under a stray VELO_DATA_DIR).
# Tooling must skip it too — see .prettierignore, eslint.config.mjs, and
# vitest.config.mjs. The privacy scanner is unaffected: it enumerates via
# `git ls-files`, so untracked worktrees are never scanned.
.claude/worktrees/

# --- Local container overrides (can embed absolute host paths) ---------------
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-compose.override.yaml
compose.override.yml
compose.override.yaml

# --- Dependencies & build output ---------------------------------------------
# Lockfiles (pnpm-lock.yaml) are deliberately committed — never ignore them.
# Match dependency directories and accidental symlinks to dependency stores.
node_modules
dist/
!apps/api/dist/
!apps/api/dist/api-runtime.mjs
!apps/api/dist/velograph-api.mjs
!apps/cli/dist/
!apps/cli/dist/cli-runtime.mjs
!apps/cli/dist/velograph-import.mjs
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vite/
.turbo/
.cache/
.eslintcache
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/

# --- OS & editor noise (editor config can embed absolute local paths) --------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
tmp/
.tmp/
*.tmp
scratch/
